{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_146_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_146","textTraditional":"一、十有四年，春，王正月，莒子朱卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_146_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_146","textTraditional":"二、夏，衞孫林父自晉歸於衞。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_146_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_146","textTraditional":"三、秋，叔孫僑如如齊逆女。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_146_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_146","textTraditional":"四、鄭公子喜帥師伐齊。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_146_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_146","textTraditional":"五、九月，僑如以夫人婦姜氏至自齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_146_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_146","textTraditional":"大夫不以夫人，以夫人非正也，刺不親迎也。僑如之挈，由上致之也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_146_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_146","textTraditional":"六、冬，十月，庚寅，衞侯臧卒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_146_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_146","textTraditional":"七、秦伯卒。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}